      "created_at": "2025-05-01T09:37:12.657Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/vipinazad-85\">@vipinazad-85</a>:</p>\n<p><code>reference_name</code> is not a field from Customer (seems for ToDo Doctype …), maybe you are using an example but have to adapt this for your use case.</p>\n<p>Somethig like that …</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.listview_settings[\"Customer\"] = {\n    hide_name_column: true,\n    button: {\n      show: function(doc) {\n        return doc.name;\n      },\n      get_label: function() {\n        return __(\"Do something ...\");\n      },\n      get_description: function(doc) {\n        return \"Description\";\n      },\n      action: function(doc) {\n        \n        frappe.msgprint(doc.name, \"This is ...\")\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
